tokscale aggregation source-derived implementation
Upstream: https://github.com/junhoyeo/tokscale
Revision: d4d1c751856e25913bce97bfbd7b254308863239
Source: crates/tokscale-core/src/aggregator.rs
Local derived implementation: src/aggregate/tokscale.rs

The local implementation adapts the upstream date/session fold and accumulator
add/merge/finalize structure to preserve explicit u64 totals, client-qualified
session identity, model/effort metadata, unknown reasoning and timestamps, local
dates, and checked overflow errors. Pricing, model canonicalization, graph
intensity, signed saturation and parallel execution are not included.

